                <Item Key="Module">Kernel::System::Ticket::Event::OTOBOAIIncrementalSynchronization</Item>
                <Item Key="Event">TicketCreate|Ticket.*Update|TicketMerge|TicketDelete|ArticleCreate|ArticleUpdate|ArticleEdit</Item>
